..!interpreter english translate noabbrev
..*****************************************************************************
.. FOP-Name       : PRICEMAINTENANCE.ROUNDING
.. Autor          : fwester
.. Verantwortlich : cl
.. Kontrolle      : tiwe
.. Functionality  : Rounds the base value using following method:
.. result = floor(basevalue / roundingfactor + 0.5) * roundingfactor
..*****************************************************************************
.set trans -
..
.continue USAGE ? _F|defined(U|roundingfactor)
.continue USAGE ? _F|defined(U|basevalue)
.continue USAGE ? _F|compatible(F|typeof(U|roundingfactor), "R")
.continue USAGE ? _F|compatible(F|typeof(U|basevalue), "R")
.continue END   ?  F|empty(U|roundingfactor)
.continue END   ?  F|empty(U|basevalue)
..
.formula U|roundingfactor = F|abs(U|roundingfactor)
.formula U|basevalue = F|floor(basevalue / roundingfactor + 0.5) * roundingfactor
..*****************************************************************************
!END
.continue
..*****************************************************************************
..
!USAGE
.set trans -
.output terminal
Undefined or wrong typed arguments found!
This program calculates specified argument basevalue
using the specified argument roundingfactor.

Both should be defined and be reals not equal 0.
The roundingfactor should be always positive.
..
!BREAK
.end 1
